[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":-1},["Reactive",2],{"MGpogTXkde":3},{"caseStudy":4,"nextProject":80,"gradients":87,"mediaunits":109},{"id":5,"cmsLocaleId":6,"lastPublished":7,"lastUpdated":8,"createdOn":9,"isArchived":10,"isDraft":10,"fieldData":11},"69ef3870d45b2542da0d305e","65c0c17643da67dca6ad7329","2026-06-26T14:48:18.528Z","2026-06-25T14:54:41.181Z","2026-04-27T10:20:32.351Z",false,{"category":12,"summary":14,"description":15,"sector":16,"year":17,"theme-color":18,"theme-textcolor":19,"accent-color":20,"cover-mediaunit":21,"tags":22,"locations":23,"challenge-title":24,"challenge-title-textcolor":25,"challenge-theme-color":26,"challenge-theme-text":19,"challenge-subtitle":27,"challenge-subtitle-small-01":28,"challenge-subtitle-large-02":29,"challenge-subtitle-small-02":30,"sticky-mediaunits":31,"overview-text":36,"overview-theme-color":19,"overview-theme-text":37,"overview-mediaunit":38,"overview-slider-mediaunits":39,"solution-title":45,"approach-title-textcolor":25,"approach-theme-color":46,"approach-theme-text":19,"approach-subtitle-large-01":47,"approach-subtitle-small-01":48,"approach-subtitle-large-02":49,"approach-subtitle-small-02":50,"shotgrid-mediaunits":51,"conclusion-title":61,"conclusion-theme-color":62,"conclusion-theme-text":63,"conclusion-subtitle-2":64,"conclusion-subtitle-small":65,"conclusion-mediaunit":66,"next-project":67,"next-case":68,"featured":69,"disabled":10,"opengraph":70,"gradients":73,"preview":77,"name":78,"slug":79},[13],"65c2fa58827f762a1046bfe8","Repositioning a 36-year giant for the future of energy","Repositioning a 36-year giant for the future of energy ","Energy","2025","#005c0f","white","#a9dc1e","6a1cb147350b6a58abdf21d2","Website","Lagos","The world was changing its mind about energy","black","#005e10","\u003Cp>At a time when the global commercial value of oil and gas was under pressure and the world was accelerating toward renewable energy, NLNG recognised that its future could not rest on legacy relevance alone.\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>It needed to position itself more sustainably for the future of energy, not only as a company with history and scale, but as one with direction, adaptability, and a clearer place in a changing global landscape.\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>That shift was made more urgent by a second challenge closer to home.\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>In Nigeria, NLNG was still often misunderstood as being fully government-owned. &nbsp;For a business trying to step into a broader and more future-facing role, that misconception made it harder for the company to be engaged at the level it now needed to occupy.\u003C/p>",[32,33,34,35],"6a1cb3c0e8d9bae930d92e17","6a1cb3d48b7d2d08a19c2422","6a1cb9fe9165c2dad287f0df","6a1cba15c4c72358e5791b31","We gave NLNG a stronger way to be encountered not as a static legacy institution explaining itself, but as a dynamic energy company actively shaping where it is going.","#1f1f1f","6a1cb42dc4c72358e577d32e",[40,41,42,43,44],"6a1cb5d8edaee5a60b84e8c2","6a1cb85abec045b07a6d8ed2","6a1cb8a86251df8cb0c3a6ba","6a1cb8c27a1f0df5964bc33a","6a1cb8dccb2062e8110742e1","Painting a new picture fit for the future","#003893","\u003Cp>NLNG partnered with us to give that strategic shift a compelling form the world could actually experience.\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>Their website was the clearest public stage on which NLNG’s next chapter could begin to speak for itself, so it had to do far more than update appearance or improve navigation. It had to help the company leave behind an older reading of itself and enter a more expansive one.\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>Built around NLNG’s new brand essence as a global energy company in motion improving lives sustainably, we redesigned NLNG’s website to communicate a business no longer content to be understood only through inherited assumptions about oil, gas, or state proximity.\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>Through a more immersive visual system, a clearer narrative structure, and a more contemporary way of organising the company’s story, we helped NLNG translate its evolved industrial credibility into a public language fit for the future. We gave the giant a stronger way to be encountered not as a static legacy institution explaining itself, but as a dynamic energy company actively shaping where it is going.\u003C/p>",[52,53,54,55,56,57,58,59,60],"6a1cd2ef5999bd4226bb12e5","6a1cd31f1a9d535903e238dc","6a1cd3774f9f44f7ac374e7e","6a1cd3a9d891929be3aadadf","6a1cd3cc8def5a8ce09ced0b","6a1cd3edcaa064ef33ceb84b","6a1cd438cb2062e8110bbcfe","6a1cd47bbec045b07a725469","6a1cd49481c60eedf1d54be2","Gaining a signal equal to stature","#e7fecd","#00380f","\u003Cp>What changed was not simply the polish of NLNG’s website, but the level at which NLNG could now be understood.\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>The new website and repositioning gave the business a more credible public face for a new era, one better suited to the expectations of partners, stakeholders, vendors, and audiences looking for signs of seriousness, adaptability, and direction in a changing energy market.\u003C/p>","6a1cda82d9dab01e908f05d2","67d297327856070969184326",null,true,{"fileId":71,"url":72,"alt":68},"6a0ec808a39e8bbc34a44724","https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65c0c17643da67dca6ad732c/6a0ec808a39e8bbc34a44724_nlng-thumbnail_compressed.webp",[74,75,76],"69ef4296ea38f64f6a9e3966","69ef537ac4d4468758866452","69ef55fffc728efd30a762b0",{"fileId":71,"url":72,"alt":68},"NLNG","nlng",{"name":81,"preview":82,"slug":85,"disabled":10,"id":67,"type":86},"Quidax",{"fileId":83,"url":84,"alt":68},"67d7c279e37df6ae8ed39fb9","https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65c0c17643da67dca6ad732c/67d7c279e37df6ae8ed39fb9_quidax-cover.webp","quidax","project",[88,94,102],{"id":74,"cmsLocaleId":6,"fieldData":89},{"color1":90,"color2":91,"angle":92,"color1-text":90,"color2-text":91,"stop1":68,"stop2":68,"name":93,"slug":93},"#91cc47","#d1dc24",133.3,"nlng-challenge",{"id":75,"cmsLocaleId":6,"fieldData":95},{"color1":96,"color2":97,"angle":98,"color1-text":96,"color2-text":97,"stop1":99,"stop2":100,"name":101,"slug":101},"rgba(147, 211, 255, 0.7)","rgba(147, 211, 255, 0.2)",126.9,9.5,62.9,"nlng-approach",{"id":76,"cmsLocaleId":6,"fieldData":103},{"color1":90,"color2":104,"angle":105,"color1-text":90,"color2-text":104,"stop1":106,"stop2":107,"name":108,"slug":108},"#93d3ff",188.7,0,100,"nlng-conclusion",{"cover":110,"sticky":117,"overview":146,"overviewSlider":158,"shotgrid":200,"conclusion":279},{"id":21,"cmsLocaleId":6,"fieldData":111},{"image":112,"video":68,"alt":68,"name":115,"slug":116},{"fileId":113,"url":114,"alt":68},"69f1e7709cbe782432c9f7c7","https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65c0c17643da67dca6ad732c/69f1e7709cbe782432c9f7c7_cover_image_compressed.webp","NLNG - CoverImage","nlng---coverimage",[118,125,132,139],{"id":32,"cmsLocaleId":6,"fieldData":119},{"image":120,"video":68,"alt":68,"name":123,"slug":124},{"fileId":121,"url":122,"alt":68},"69f1e77ce3a90c211c05de1e","https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65c0c17643da67dca6ad732c/69f1e77ce3a90c211c05de1e_challenge_01_compressed.webp","NLNG - ChallengeImg1","nlng---challengeimg1",{"id":33,"cmsLocaleId":6,"fieldData":126},{"image":127,"video":68,"alt":68,"name":130,"slug":131},{"fileId":128,"url":129,"alt":68},"69f1e77c61b5ed79c6049f46","https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65c0c17643da67dca6ad732c/69f1e77c61b5ed79c6049f46_challenge_02_compressed.webp","NLNG - ChallengeImg2","nlng---challengeimg2",{"id":34,"cmsLocaleId":6,"fieldData":133},{"image":134,"video":68,"alt":68,"name":137,"slug":138},{"fileId":135,"url":136,"alt":68},"6a1cb9f4c4c72358e579120a","https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65c0c17643da67dca6ad732c/6a1cb9f4c4c72358e579120a_approach1_compressed.webp","NLNG - ApproachImg1","nlng---approachimg1",{"id":35,"cmsLocaleId":6,"fieldData":140},{"image":141,"video":68,"alt":68,"name":144,"slug":145},{"fileId":142,"url":143,"alt":68},"69f1e7a83e6db81ad59be964","https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65c0c17643da67dca6ad732c/69f1e7a83e6db81ad59be964_approach_02_compressed.webp","NLNG - ApproachImg2","nlng---a